The Readest application (https://github.com/readest/readest) is AGPL-3.0.
None of that application's source is included here. This directory contains
only the foliate-js library files required to open a reflowable EPUB:

- view.js, epub.js, epubcfi.js, paginator.js, progress.js, overlayer.js,
  text-walker.js, section-chunks.js
- vendor/zip.js (BSD-3-Clause, vendored by foliate-js)

PDF.js, fixed-layout.js, and the Readest UI are intentionally not vendored.
fixed-layout.js imports the npm package construct-style-sheets-polyfill,
which is not bundled. Fixed-layout EPUBs are outside this lab corpus.

The lab host page (host.html) is original Reader Lab code. It uses the
public foliate-view custom element: open(), init(), goTo(), the flow
attribute, and the load and relocate events.
